# Screenshots and scratch images. Naming individual files kept letting new ones
# through (shot_, nav_, mob_, ...), so ignore every PNG/JPG at the repo root.
# charts/ is a subdirectory and stays tracked — that one holds deliverables.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

